4
00:00:12.930 --> 00:00:15.470
Ja minu väike.

5
00:00:15.570 --> 00:00:17.540
Karupeake.

6
00:00:17.640 --> 00:00:20.610
On karu Tartus täis.

7
00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:29.470
